\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Code Buddy\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/phuetz/code-buddy\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source multi-provider AI coding agent with terminal + Electron desktop interfaces. Features local-first execution on Ollama, 15 LLM providers with automatic failover, ~110 tools, and 24/7 multi-AI fleet capabilities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-25\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude User Memory\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/VAMFI/claude-user-memory\",\n    \"description\": \"Autonomous agent substrate for Claude Code CLI implementing Research→Plan→Implement workflows with quality gates, TDD enforcement, and multi-agent coordination. Built on Anthropic's engineering research with 4.8-5.5x faster development claims.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-25\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Koder\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/feiskyer/koder\",\n    \"description\": \"An experimental, open-source AI coding assistant for the terminal that combines a streaming TUI, persistent local sessions, durable goals and scheduled loops, repository-aware tools, extensible skills, MCP integrations, and sandbox-aware permissions in one Python runtime.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Terminator\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/iris-networks/terminator\",\n    \"description\": \"A completely free opensource alternative to manus, openhands and cua. Multi-agent AI platform for code execution, research, and browser automation with standalone binary deployment.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-27\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Deadend CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/straylabs-ai/deadend-cli\",\n    \"description\": \"Agentic pentest tooling achieving 81% on XBOW's benchmark in full black-box. Completely self-hosted with support for every model available on LiteLLM (Ollama, Anthropic, OpenAI, etc.). Autonomous web application penetration testing agent using feedback-driven iteration.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-22\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hcom\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/aannoo/hcom\",\n    \"description\": \"CLI tool that enables AI coding agents to communicate, watch, and spawn each other across terminals. Single Rust binary with no background services. Supports Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Antigravity CLI, Cursor CLI, OpenCode, Kilo, Pi, Kimi, and Copilot CLI.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-21\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CC-Switch\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch\",\n    \"description\": \"A cross-platform desktop All-in-One assistant for Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, OpenClaw, Grok Build & Hermes Agent. Written in Rust using Tauri framework to provide unified interface for multiple AI coding CLI tools.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-08-04\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AI Instructions\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/arkatom/ai-instructions\",\n    \"description\": \"CLI tool to scaffold AI development instructions for ClaudeCode, Cursor, GitHub Copilot and more. Provides complete instruction templates and 90 specialized agents for different development tasks.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-08-03\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Gemini CLI New\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/aigo666/gemini-cli-new\",\n    \"description\": \"An open-source AI agent bringing Gemini's power directly to your terminal with native proxy API support. Features include querying and editing large codebases within Gemini's 1M token context window, multimodal capabilities, and MCP server integrations.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-31\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Kubiks CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/kubiks-inc/kubiks-cli\",\n    \"description\": \"Automatically instruments applications to capture comprehensive runtime data (logs, traces, requests, AI SDK calls) and integrates with AI code editors like Cursor through MCP to provide complete debugging context.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-31\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MCPDog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/kinhunt/mcpdog\",\n    \"description\": \"Universal MCP Server Manager that allows users to configure multiple MCP servers through a single interface. Features web dashboard, auto-detection, and unified proxy layer. Perfect for Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI & AI assistants.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-29\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude MPM (Multi-Agent Project Manager)\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/bobmatnyc/claude-mpm\",\n    \"description\": \"Workflow and agent management framework for Claude Code CLI with 47+ specialized agents, 56+ bundled skills, full MCP integration, session management, and GitHub-first SDK mode.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2025-07-25\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n